{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spellers is a 2v2 battle game where players fight to capture the zone and claim victory. You fight your opponents using Spells you cast by typing their names on your keyboard. Typing fast is just as important as aiming well! The game features over 15 different Spells for you to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture the Zone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against the enemy team on a map centered around a capture zone. Fill your gauge by staying inside it! If one or more opponents step in, the zone becomes contested. You\u2019ll have to fight to make sure your team is the only one inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/3dc9af6157f0611a21c72d94ab4584ff.poster.avif?t=1760310100\" width=628 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/3dc9af6157f0611a21c72d94ab4584ff.webm?t=1760310100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/3dc9af6157f0611a21c72d94ab4584ff.mp4?t=1760310100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the zone by combining over 15 Spells to attack or defend. You summon a Spell by typing its name on your keyboard (if you don\u2019t mess it up !)<br>Burn, poison, blind, or even turn invisible\u2026 all these Spells will help you win the fight !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/b8f050cde208e03a67393722408aa3e5.poster.avif?t=1760310100\" width=628 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/b8f050cde208e03a67393722408aa3e5.webm?t=1760310100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/b8f050cde208e03a67393722408aa3e5.mp4?t=1760310100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wardrobe of Wizardry</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your player with robes, hats, and wands that you unlock through battles. Whether you\u2019re a commander or a magical clown, everything must be earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/137f0feb6e4a6af316248cb543471b21.poster.avif?t=1760310100\" width=628 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/137f0feb6e4a6af316248cb543471b21.webm?t=1760310100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/137f0feb6e4a6af316248cb543471b21.mp4?t=1760310100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/42077cb9f4a934bdceaef88d6da5ae83.webp?t=1760310100\" width=628 height=55 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1933010?t=1760310100","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1933010?t=1760310100","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/f4c151d529c20183a46b197565ca010ffec77e9e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760310100","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/f4c151d529c20183a46b197565ca010ffec77e9e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760310100","categories":[{"description":"Mult